  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical assistance towards brucellosis control in Armenia, Kazakhstan, and Uzbekistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will support a thorough assessment of the current relevant control plans and strategies, ruminant identification systems, protocols and legal frameworks. These will be revised and/or developed as needed, and validated through desktop simulation exercises and drills. The establishment and reinforcement of National One Health coordination working groups will facilitate collaboration.</narrative>
  </description>
